description	"Astromech Droid

^9Weapons:
- Melee Interface
^1-- Heavyweight
^1-- Sec fire only
- Jet Burst (Flamethrower)
^2-- Hit: Burn
^2-- Damage: 11x
^1-- Reload speed: .0004x
- Fusioncutter (Welder 1)
^1-- Damage: .9x

^3Abilities:
- BP/Resource Dispenser (2) ^3[Use]
^2-- Range: 96u
- Jet Boosters ^3[Hold/double jump]
- Pocket Laser ^3[CS1]
- Panic (Barge 3) ^3[Melee CS2]

^5Powers:
- Steam Projector (Push 1)
^2-- Use: Shrouds
- Electroshock Probe (Lightning 1) ^3[CS4]
^2-- Damage: 2x
- Overclock (Speed 2) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Healing (2)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Passive Radar Scanner (Miraluka 1)
- Impact Diffusion
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Triggerbound
^2- Resource regen: 2/1.5s
^2- Hack speed: 1.25x
^1- Skill recharge: .57x

A plucky support with numerous gadgets."